    "detailed_description": "&quot;Path of Yuusha&quot; is a simulation game set in the Yuusha academy with life sim elements of decorating your room freely and attempting events at local town. Experiencing the daily life of a school student who is busy with classes and work, Manages your weekly schedule and cultivates your character into a splendid hero.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/55718b9830932ee6e1d5018b13dc9215.poster.avif?t=1672910599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/55718b9830932ee6e1d5018b13dc9215.webm?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/55718b9830932ee6e1d5018b13dc9215.mp4?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Schedule</h2>Plan your weekly schedule and adjust it according to your character's needs, whether it's learning spells in the magic academy, practice alchemy in the witch's hut, working at local restaurant as a waiter or just simply stay at home watching TV.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/1947d80dbe7766e4e298e78e6301f624.poster.avif?t=1672910599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/1947d80dbe7766e4e298e78e6301f624.webm?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/1947d80dbe7766e4e298e78e6301f624.mp4?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Lovey Home</h2>Decorate your own Home with various furniture and invite your friends to your home on the weekend. Those furniture are not only cute and good looking, it will provide different types of benefit to enhance your character.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/ae07d60cbda9dd2fd9d25c9c1ad0dd2f.poster.avif?t=1672910599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/ae07d60cbda9dd2fd9d25c9c1ad0dd2f.webm?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/ae07d60cbda9dd2fd9d25c9c1ad0dd2f.mp4?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Pets</h2>You can catch and taming different kind of pet in Path of Yuusha, every pet will have its own unique expertise, some can help you defeat monsters in dungeon, some can help you grow herbs in your backyard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/3e7187ce286e02b5d18bc60b30778e2c.poster.avif?t=1672910599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/3e7187ce286e02b5d18bc60b30778e2c.webm?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/3e7187ce286e02b5d18bc60b30778e2c.mp4?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure with your Friends</h2>Dungeon are full of Monsters and Treasures, meet with other adventurers in the Adventures' guild to venture together deep in to the dungeon, looting  and defeating the monsters, collecting weapon and armor to enhance your character.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/966c8c6897680d23b543806fb817a80b.poster.avif?t=1672910599\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/966c8c6897680d23b543806fb817a80b.webm?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234950/extras/966c8c6897680d23b543806fb817a80b.mp4?t=1672910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
